Package: loaf
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libgl1, libglvnd0
Recommends: qt6-base-dev | libqt6gui6, qt6-declarative-dev | libqt6qml6, qt6-wayland
Maintainer: m_uvex <m_uvex@localhost>
Homepage: https://github.com/m-uvex/loaf
Description: Material 3 Expressive File Manager
 Loaf is a modern, fast file manager built with Qt6 Quick and Rust,
 featuring Material 3 Expressive design, spring animations, and native system integration.
